  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2170,
   "y": 769,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft token t+2`"
  },
  {
   "id": "mver31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1850,
   "y": 830,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**verify**: main model checks the draft in its next forward",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1850,
   "y": 916,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "MTP = multi-token prediction (1 block, 9.95B stored). Trained to predict one token further; at inference serving stacks use it as a speculative-decoding draft. Not part of transformers' GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM — wiring here is read from its tensor names (no embed / head tensors of its own)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": 825,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json + safetensors headers of zai-org/GLM-5.3 (118629 tensors; FP8 E4M3 weights in 128×128 blocks, scales not counted). Main model (L0–77, embed, head) = **743.38B**, +9.95B MTP. Dataflow from transformers modeling_glm_moe_dsa.py. Context 1,048,576 positions; RoPE θ = 8,000,000 on 64 dims only."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-flash",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": 1005,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**GLM-5.3-Flash is a different design** (glm5_next, ~321B in safetensors): 45 layers, hidden 4096, hybrid of 34 KDA linear-attention + 11 DSA layers, mHC ×4 residual lanes, 288 routed experts, NoPE MLA, and a 24-layer ViT for images/video. Not drawn here."
  }
 ],
